You draw deeply from your connection with nature to create a radius [3, 5, 6, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] storm of natural forces around you for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

This storm moves with you and deals [59, 79, 95, 108, 120 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Nature damage each turn to all foes it hits.

In addtion, it will drain up to [16, 22, 27, 30, 34 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Mana, [8, 11, 13, 15, 17 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Vim, [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Positive, and [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Negative energy from each enemy within it's area every turn, while you restore Equilibrium equal to 10% of the amount drained.

The damage and drain increase with your Mindpower.
